Skyknot: So back to the little story.\
...\
Once upon a time, there was a mortal named {PlayerName}.
Skyknot: {PlayerName} was a normal mortal, human, dumb and stinky.\
But they had a good idea for once \: please the greater good
Skyknot: And so they did, by making deliveries in a city where teleporting devices are as common as human are weak
Skyknot: And to keep it exciting, you will be cut off a member for each delivery not made on time.
Skyknot: May the odds be ever in your favor, and be sure to fail a delivery or two to be fun to watch.
[end_timeline]